{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6e6b7a2a-2f1a-4a1a-9d3a-wedify0000001",
    "name": "Wedify API",
    "description": "Postman collection cho toan bo REST API cua Wedify (NestJS + Prisma + MySQL). Server mac dinh chay o http://localhost:4000/api/v1 (npm run start:dev trong thu muc api/).\n\nCach dung nhanh (dung theo thu tu):\n1. Auth > Register (Host) hoac Login (Host) - tu dong luu accessToken/refreshToken/userId vao collection variable.\n2. Invitations > Create Invitation - tu dong luu invitationId/invitationSlug.\n3. Guests > Create Guest - tu dong luu guestId/guestToken (dung cho cac request Guest-facing/RSVP/Wishes).\n4. De test nhom Admin (Users/Plans/Templates admin, Withdrawals, Affiliates duyet...): tao 1 user role=ADMIN thu cong qua Prisma Studio (npm run db:studio, sua truc tiep cot role), roi chay Auth > Login (Admin) de lay adminAccessToken rieng.\n\nCac request public (khong can dang nhap: Guest-facing, RSVP, Wishes cong khai, danh sach Plans/Templates) da danh dau auth = No Auth.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (Host)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{hostEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{hostPassword}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Minh Anh\",\n  \"phone\": \"0901234567\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dang ky Host moi. Tu dong luu accessToken/refreshToken/userId."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('userId', json.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
